  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> A nearby ally braces a character's shoulder as they force open a stuck portcullis or heavy stone door. Adds 1d4 when a Strength ability check with a known DC has failed. The helper spends a reaction.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. If an option has a count requirement, that resource is spent when the option is accepted, according to External Reaction's count handling.</p>",
